Subject: [PATCH] Add FX Pixel (com.xieguiawu.currencytransfer)

Retro-pixel Android app for currency exchange rates (open.er-api.com)
and inflation calculation (World Bank CPI).

- MIT licensed, keyless public data sources (AntiFeatures: NonFreeNet)
- Single INTERNET permission, HTTPS only, zero tracking
- Reproducible build verified (dual-build SHA-256 match at tag v1.0.0)
- Fastlane metadata (en-US / zh-CN) in-repo
- Category Market & Price (validated against config/categories.yml)
